          "prompt": "An over-collateralized lending market on Fhenix where each account holds encrypted collateral and debt as euint64. borrow(inEuint64 amt) computes the health factor FHE.div(FHE.mul(collateral, ltvBps), newDebt) and gates it with FHE.gte(hf, MIN_HF) and FHE.select so unsafe borrows net zero. A keeper liquidate uses FHE.req on an underwater ebool to authorize seizure, surfaced via FHE.decrypt. Borrowers read their position via FHE.sealoutput under a permit. A plaintext-position dashboard with no euint health-factor math, FHE.req gate, or sealed reads is a shim; the artifact compiles under forge.",
